4. **Zero-Asset Architecture**:
   - 100% Procedural Audio via Web Audio API (oscillators, noise buffers, gain nodes). Zero external .mp3/.wav files.
   - 100% Procedural Visuals via Canvas 2D / SVG vector paths. Zero external .png/.jpg textures.
5. **Quality Standard**:
   - 60–120 FPS continuous performance with requestAnimationFrame delta timing.
   - Object pooling for projectiles and particles to prevent GC stutter.
   - Clean HUD with responsive touch joystick support for mobile.
   - 0 browser console errors.
